data: {"id": "331ae92c64454416-thinking-parallel_evidence-825", "run_id": "331ae92c64454416", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 1. 实体与身份\n- **Pod**: `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974`，UID: `9de01e2a-aa28-4619-947b-d99f9a8a8897`\n- **Node**: `node2` (10.2.0.50)\n- **控制器**: ReplicaSet `workload-5b5fc86c8c` → Deployment `workload`\n- **容器**: 单个 `app` 容器 (`python:3-alpine`)\n- **生命周期状态**: `phase=Pending`，容器状态 `Waiting / ContainerCreating`，重启 0 次。\n\n## 2. 支持候选原因的证据\n**候选原因：Volume Mount Failed (ConfigMap \"unavailable-config\" 缺失)**\n\n*   **Events (核心证据)**: 两个重复事件直接指向根因：\n    1.  `MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : c", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789051739789, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

