me \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found`。\n2. **状态印证**：Pod 长时间处于 `ContainerCreating` 等待状态 (fact-65594218e962)，且没有重启记录 (fact-a69b5384ad65, restart_count: 0)，符合启动前依赖项（ConfigMap）缺失导致的静态阻塞特征。\n3. **排除干扰**：系统资源请求极低 (fact-12401c0ffbc5, memory: 8Mi)，且监控未见相关 OOM 或调度失败指标，排除了资源竞争因素。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.2m\n├─ 问题定位: 19.1s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 39.5s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974: 39.5s (Evidence 30.9s, RCA 8.5s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 11.7s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974**: pod-volume-mount-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 70.38, "metrics": {"run_id": "331ae92c64454416", "mttr": {"value": "1.2m", "seconds": 70.3850200176239, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-volume-mount-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "d